        "# Environmental cost estimate\n",
        "This section estimates the environmental cost of the project. The estimate is approximate because the exact energy use of a Google Colab session is not directly measured in the notebook. I estimate the footprint from runtime, approximate compute power, data storage, and repeated model training. The project mainly used CPU-based computation, with a small neural network and a subset-based Gaussian Process model to reduce unnecessary compute."
