          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "For the compute estimate, I use a simple energy calculation. The estimated energy use is runtime multiplied by average power draw and a data-centre overhead factor. I use a conservative CPU-based Colab estimate here because this notebook does not require heavy GPU training. The carbon estimate is calculated using an approximate grid carbon intensity. These values are not exact measurements, but they give a transparent estimate of the project scale."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "hSo49ZulnI-s"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Approximate environmental cost estimate\n",
        "\n",
        "# Change this value if your actual total Colab runtime is different\n",
        "estimated_runtime_hours = 3.0\n",
        "\n",
        "# Approximate average power for a CPU-based Colab session\n",
        "average_power_watts = 50\n",
        "\n",
        "# Data-centre power usage effectiveness factor\n",
        "pue = 1.2\n",
        "\n",
        "# Approximate grid carbon intensity in kg CO2e per kWh\n",
        "carbon_intensity_kg_per_kwh = 0.4\n",
        "\n",
